{"id":"vod_sn_37843","vodId":"37843","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"日式面包王","name_cn":"日式面包王","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c7ff32b45420b8fdcbade5f366d8f6d3.jpg"},"summary":"面包是一款老少皆宜的美食，在某些国家，人们甚至将面包作为每日的主食。在这世上，有英式面包，有法式长棍，有德式全麦，但却偏偏没有所谓的日式面包，对于身为纯正日本人的少年东和马（小林由美子 配音）来说，这不能不算是一种遗憾。因此，从小就对面包有着深厚感情的东和马决定走上面包的修罗之路，发誓要制作出能够代表日本的面包，让日式面包称霸全球。　　东和马的秘密武器是一双比常人温度略高的手掌，人称“太阳之手”，经过这双手揉制发酵的面团总是能够为食客带来惊喜。在修炼的途中，东和马结识了热血青年河内恭介（阪口周平 配音）和面包店老板的女儿梓川月乃（大冢千寻 配音）。在三人的努力之下，他们在世界范围内的各大面包大赛中崭露头角，逐渐的朝向梦想的终点前进着。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":69,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EdvcAh5z7C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jK5yJhHMwp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZRCMU8JY3F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N9zhf1f5T81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kkgJWSBzjJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F6YMcZsBw91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q7Nhvdxnbv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DpwzRSmyDW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YWVZc3X8P91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4yjWWvCKVk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tfxDtUtQqe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PGWFSwSgQn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kh3db6muqP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J5R7nmh61Z